American Academy of Orthopaedic Surgeons, OrthoInfo. Sprains, Strains, and Other Soft-Tissue Injuries. English.

[Authorized source](https://www.orthoinfo.org/diseases--conditions/sprains-strains-and-other-soft-tissue-injuries/).

Read the complete introduction and the named acute-injury, sprain, strain, and overuse sections for a tissue-based vocabulary before studying the shoulder. Distinguish structural continuity, symptoms, and function. The treatment sections are general patient education, not an individualized prescription or a substitute for later condition-specific evidence.

